[{"answer":"Hello, how may I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I've been seeing these yellow boxes in front of a lot of houses in my neighbourhood.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/2.mp3"},{"answer":"just wondered what they were for.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I noticed your phone number on all of them, so I called.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you tell me about your business?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/5.mp3"},{"answer":"We do do recycling, but we're not a business.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Gaea's Guardians is a non-profit group.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/7.mp3"},{"answer":"We encourage recycling as a way of protecting the environment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean it is a good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/10.mp3"},{"answer":"But I really don't read the newspaper every day or anything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/11.mp3"},{"answer":"And we don't come collect newspapers every day!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/12.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, we only do pickups every other week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, well then maybe I could help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean in my neighbourhood, there's too much rubbish lying around everywhere.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to help out, I guess.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/16.mp3"},{"answer":"That's great, sir.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/17.mp3"},{"answer":"You're doing the right thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/18.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, I need to get your contact information.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/19.mp3"},{"answer":"What's your name, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Peter Wisrough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Peter... how do you spell your last name?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Wisrow?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/23.mp3"},{"answer":"No, actually it's Wisrough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I'm sorry. I'm a terrible speller.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/25.mp3"},{"answer":"You're a good speller.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/26.mp3"},{"answer":"It's just that my family are terrible pronouncers!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/27.mp3"},{"answer":"You're quite a card, Peter!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/28.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, now what's your address?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/29.mp3"},{"answer":"No. 168 Bridge Road.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/30.mp3"},{"answer":"That's here in London.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/31.mp3"},{"answer":"How about if I have any questions?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sending you a copy of our booklet, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/33.mp3"},{"answer":"The booklet has our phone number and our e-mail address,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/34.mp3"},{"answer":"helpline@blackcat.com,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/35.mp3"},{"answer":"that's helpline@blackcat.com","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/36.mp3"},{"answer":"But I nearly forgot to ask, what's your postcode?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/37.mp3"},{"answer":"BS97PU.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/38.mp3"},{"answer":"PS97BU?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/39.mp3"},{"answer":"No. That's B as in \"boy\" S-9-7-P as in \"Peter\" U.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/40.mp3"},{"answer":"So, I'm guessing those yellow boxes I saw are for recycled newspapers?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that is correct, and it's free of charge.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Wow, that's good news!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you recycle anything besides newspaper?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes, we recycle most everything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Glass, plastic, paper...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, so I can put like glass and plastic bottles in the box?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Sorry again. Things like that you have to bring to our collection centre","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/48.mp3"},{"answer":"And where is that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Our main centre isn't that far from you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/50.mp3"},{"answer":"It's actually right on the East Side of Central Park.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/51.mp3"},{"answer":"That new blue building?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/52.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the one!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Cool. Hey, what's with all those different coloured boxes outside that place?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's for the different materials we recycle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/55.mp3"},{"answer":"The blue is for metal, the green is for glass and plastics,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/56.mp3"},{"answer":"and the yellow of course is for paper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm, okay. I'll try and manage to keep all that straight.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, no need, they're each labelled.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Great. So which one would I put magazines in?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, they don't go in any of the bins.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Unfortunately, magazines can't be recycled because of the material they're made of.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/62.mp3"},{"answer":"It's such a waste.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/63.mp3"},{"answer":"So would you be interested in volunteering?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Um, I'll think about it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you send me some more info?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Absolutely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Along with the newspaper box, I'll be sending you our booklet,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/68.mp3"},{"answer":"\"Savvy\", that is S-A-V-V-Y.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/69.mp3"},{"answer":"It tells you about what you can do to protect the environment in your daily life.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Plus it lists things you can do as a volunteer with our group.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Hey, that's cool, thanks!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/72.mp3"},{"answer":"My pleasure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have any other questions or concerns?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Nope, that's it!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-13-2019-03-27-16-05-16/75.mp3"}]
